              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "LadyB"
            },
            "reviewBody": "The hubby and I tried it; although, I changed the semi-sweet morsels to 85% cocoa chocolate. I'm sure the semi-sweet chocolate is much better. Overall, I will make them again.",
            "datePublished": "2006-09-05T19:51:37.123Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "3"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Allrecipes Member"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I used Marsala wine and dried figs. Stuffing was enough to fill 26 dried figs.\r\nIt was easy enough to make a cavity in each dried fig with my index finger.\r\nIt took me about 15 minutes to stuff all of the figs. The product was little bite-sized morsels, and I have to admit I was somewhat disappointed in the overall taste. I bet fresh figs would be 100 times better. I also recommend serving as soon as they are cool enough to eat.",
            "datePublished": "2001-01-08T06:30:17.717Z"
          }
